# OBD-II mode 04 refused with conditionsNotCorrect.
#
# The refusal an ECU gives when it will not clear emission DTCs — and the
# reason the programming precondition (0x0203) is refused a few requests later.
# IDs are informational: the fake adapter matches on the UDS payload.

T 700 04
R 7E8 7f 04 22
